  "content": "<section class=\"gl-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-hero-heading\"><div class=\"gl-hero-video\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><iframe data-hero-start=\"5\" title=\"GioLina wedding film background\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/548643452?background=1&amp;autoplay=1&amp;muted=1&amp;loop=1&amp;playsinline=1#t=5s\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe></div><div class=\"gl-hero-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Wedding cinematography &amp; photography</p><h1 id=\"gl-hero-heading\"><span>Wedding films</span><span>with a personal</span><span>perspective.</span></h1><p class=\"gl-hero-sub\">Beautifully captured. Deeply felt.</p><a class=\"gl-button gl-button-light\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div><script type=\"module\" src=\"/homepage-hero-video.js\"></script></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-introduction\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-introduction-title\"><div class=\"gl-home-intro-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">A personal approach</p><h2 id=\"gl-introduction-title\">Your wedding.<br>Seen with care.</h2><p>We get to know you, prepare carefully, and give you room to enjoy the day. GioLina brings that same care to your films and photographs.</p></div><div class=\"gl-home-editorial-collage\" aria-label=\"Selected wedding photographs\"><!-- TEMPORARY PORTFOLIO SELECTION: individual images may be replaced after the SmugMug archive review; retain each slot and intrinsic dimensions. --><figure class=\"gl-collage-anchor\" data-image-slot=\"anchor\"><img src=\"/assets/e4af9615d9109ffc.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Bride walking through a garden\"></figure><figure class=\"gl-collage-intimate\" data-image-slot=\"intimate\"><img src=\"/assets/cefe0daaa70fe868.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A wedding couple together in black and white\"></figure><figure class=\"gl-collage-candid\" data-image-slot=\"candid\"><img src=\"/assets/8434dc8d16bb070d.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A couple laughing together beside the city skyline\"></figure><figure class=\"gl-collage-detail\" data-image-slot=\"detail\"><img src=\"/assets/316b610b7c81e5a1.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Wedding bouquet and handwritten card\"></figure><figure class=\"gl-collage-celebration\" data-image-slot=\"celebration\"><img src=\"/assets/5b571a210b952d2d.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Wedding celebration beneath fireworks\"></figure></div></section>\n<figure class=\"gl-home-feature-photo\" data-temporary-image-slot=\"wide-feature\"><!-- Temporary existing GioLina feature photograph; swap source and dimensions after archive review. Static by design. --><img src=\"/assets/photo-7353475231731939-1600.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/photo-7353475231731939-960.webp 960w, /assets/photo-7353475231731939-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A wedding couple together beside the waterfront\"></figure>\n<section class=\"gl-home-stories gl-home-selection gl-home-gateway\" aria-label=\"Discover GioLina\"><div class=\"gl-story-grid\"><article><a class=\"gl-destination-card\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation\" data-rotate-images data-temporary-image-slot=\"home-cinematography\" style=\"--image-ratio:16/9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-1.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"is-current\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-2.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-3.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-4.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"></div><h3>Cinematography</h3><span class=\"gl-text-link\">View films →</span></a></article><article><a class=\"gl-destination-card\" href=\"/portfolio/\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation\" data-rotate-images data-temporary-image-slot=\"home-photography\" style=\"--image-ratio:16/9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-1.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"is-current\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-2.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-3.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-4.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"></div><h3>Photography</h3><span class=\"gl-text-link\">View photographs →</span></a></article><article><a class=\"gl-destination-card\" href=\"/experience-2/\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation\" data-rotate-images data-temporary-image-slot=\"home-experience\" style=\"--image-ratio:16/9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-1.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"is-current\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-2.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-3.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"><img data-src=\"/assets/temporary-rotation-4.svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\"></div><h3>Experience</h3><span class=\"gl-text-link\">Discover the experience →</span></a></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-inquiry\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-home-inquiry-title\"><h2 id=\"gl-home-inquiry-title\">Let’s talk about your wedding.</h2><a class=\"gl-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></section>\n<script src=\"/image-rotation.js\" defer></script>",
